  "description": "YITAMOTOR is one of the largest automotive running boards and vehicle accessories retailers in the United States. We take pride in our quality control to assuring that providing only the highest quality running boards and auto accessories to our customers.\nFitment\n2018-2026 Jeep Wrangler JL 4 Door\nFeatures\nCompatibility: YITAMOTOR step bars feature a distinct drop-down step design that’s perfectly compatible with 2018-2026 Jeep Wrangler JL 4 Door.\nDurable Material: The running boards made of durable and rust-resistant ABS plastic, making them lightweight and fuel-efficient. You can trust that they will withstand even the toughest of conditions.\nAnti-slip Surface: Step bar covers feature a textured surface that prevents slips and falls when getting in and out of your vehicle. Your safety is our top priority, and we want to ensure that you feel secure every time you step on your boards.\nPerfect Fit: The pedal covers are designed to be the perfect length and height for your vehicle, ensuring that they look great once installed and won't interfere with your driving experience. You'll love how they enhance the overall appearance of your car while making it easier to get in and out.\nEasy Installation: We've made installation a breeze with improved DIY installation manual. YITAMOTOR nerf bar covers can be easily installed using bolts, without the need for drilling or cutting. You'll have them installed in no time and be on your way to enjoying the many benefits they offer.\nProfessional installation recommended",
